  m_text: "Each VHS tape belongs to a specific subgenre.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Check the
    cover, title, and sticker to identify the tape\u2019s subgenre.\r\n\u2022 Find
    the shelf with the matching label. Subgenre labels also have stickers \u2014
    compare them with the one on the tape.\r\n\u2022 Place the tape on the correct
    shelf.\r\n\r\nYou can use any empty slot on the matching shelf. A glow and a
    sound will confirm correct placement.\r\n\r\nSunset Creek tapes are the exception:
    their order matters.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d151009054bc0304b819a28408f8d5ad, type: 2}
